   "has_notes": false,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "s03-b01",
     "shape": "TextBox 2",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 320040,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "INTRODUCTION AND PLACE PROFILE",
     "role": "title"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03-b02",
     "shape": "TextBox 4",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 6473952,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "CHHATTISGARH FORMAL SURVEY REPORT  •  03",
     "role": "footer"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03-b03",
     "shape": "TextBox 6",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Chhattisgarh is a state in central India, formed on 1 November 2000 after separation from Madhya Pradesh.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03-b04",
     "shape": "TextBox 8",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2103120,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "The capital is Raipur; the state is known for forests, mineral resources, agriculture, tribal culture, and industry.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03-b05",
     "shape": "TextBox 10",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2971800,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "The ancient region associated with present-day Chhattisgarh is commonly known as Dakshin Kosala.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s03-b06",
     "shape": "TextBox 12",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 3840480,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "The state combines rural and urban communities, traditional livelihoods, and modern infrastructure development.",
     "role": "item"
    }
   ],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "layout": "Blank",
   "shape_count": 12,
   "picture_shapes": 0,
   "has_notes": false,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "s04-b01",
     "shape": "TextBox 2",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 320040,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "GEOGRAPHICAL DETAILS AND POPULATION",
     "role": "title"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04-b02",
     "shape": "TextBox 4",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 6473952,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "CHHATTISGARH FORMAL SURVEY REPORT  •  04",
     "role": "footer"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04-b03",
     "shape": "TextBox 6",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Located in central India; it shares boundaries with Madhya Pradesh, Maharashtra, Telangana, Odisha, Jharkhand, and Uttar Pradesh.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04-b04",
     "shape": "TextBox 8",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2103120,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Terrain includes plains, plateaus, forested hills, river valleys, and mineral-rich regions.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04-b05",
     "shape": "TextBox 10",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2971800,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "The Mahanadi and its tributaries are important to the state's geography and agriculture.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s04-b06",
     "shape": "TextBox 12",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 3840480,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "The 2011 Census recorded a population of approximately 2.55 crore; newer estimates may differ.",
     "role": "item"
    }
   ],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "layout": "Blank",
   "shape_count": 12,
   "picture_shapes": 0,
   "has_notes": false,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "s05-b01",
     "shape": "TextBox 2",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 320040,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "ENVIRONMENTAL DETAILS",
     "role": "title"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05-b02",
     "shape": "TextBox 4",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 6473952,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "CHHATTISGARH FORMAL SURVEY REPORT  •  05",
     "role": "footer"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05-b03",
     "shape": "TextBox 6",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Chhattisgarh has extensive forests, diverse wildlife, rivers, waterfalls, and mineral deposits.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05-b04",
     "shape": "TextBox 8",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2103120,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Forests support biodiversity and many rural and tribal livelihoods.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05-b05",
     "shape": "TextBox 10",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2971800,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Concerns include forest degradation, mining and industrial pollution, water pressure, and waste management.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s05-b06",
     "shape": "TextBox 12",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 3840480,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Useful measures: native-species afforestation, water conservation, cleaner industry, renewable energy, responsible mining, and recycling.",
     "role": "item"
    }
   ],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "layout": "Blank",
   "shape_count": 12,
   "picture_shapes": 0,
   "has_notes": false,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "s06-b01",
     "shape": "TextBox 2",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 320040,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "HABITAT AND LIFESTYLE",
     "role": "title"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06-b02",
     "shape": "TextBox 4",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 6473952,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "CHHATTISGARH FORMAL SURVEY REPORT  •  06",
     "role": "footer"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06-b03",
     "shape": "TextBox 6",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "People live in villages, small towns, and growing urban centres such as Raipur, Bilaspur, Durg-Bhilai, and Korba.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06-b04",
     "shape": "TextBox 8",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2103120,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Rural livelihoods include farming, forest-produce collection, animal husbandry, crafts, and local trade.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06-b05",
     "shape": "TextBox 10",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2971800,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Culture is expressed through folk music and dance, festivals, traditional crafts, cuisine, and regional languages.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s06-b06",
     "shape": "TextBox 12",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 3840480,
     "left": 1051560,
     "text": "Access to education, healthcare, transport, and commerce varies; remote forested areas may face longer travel distances.",
     "role": "item"
    }
   ],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "layout": "Blank",
   "shape_count": 14,
   "picture_shapes": 0,
   "has_notes": false,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "s07-b01",
     "shape": "TextBox 2",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 320040,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "TECHNOLOGY AND SCIENCE",
     "role": "title"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07-b02",
     "shape": "TextBox 4",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 6473952,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "CHHATTISGARH FORMAL SURVEY REPORT  •  07",
     "role": "footer"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07-b03",
     "shape": "TextBox 6",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Technology supports mining, steel production, power generation, agriculture, transport, public services, and urban management.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07-b04",
     "shape": "TextBox 8",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2194560,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Digital services and mobile connectivity can improve access to information and government services.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07-b05",
     "shape": "TextBox 10",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 3154680,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Potential improvements include sensor-based mine safety and predictive maintenance in factories.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07-b06",
     "shape": "TextBox 12",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 6446520,
     "text": "Solar-powered cold storage, digital marketplaces, offline-first healthcare tools, and regional-language STEM platforms can help.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s07-b07",
     "shape": "TextBox 14",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2194560,
     "left": 6446520,
     "text": "Innovation should be affordable, accessible to rural users, locally suitable, and supported by training and maintenance.",
     "role": "item"
    }
   ],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "layout": "Blank",
   "shape_count": 14,
   "picture_shapes": 0,
   "has_notes": false,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "s08-b01",
     "shape": "TextBox 2",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 320040,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "AMENITIES AVAILABLE",
     "role": "title"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08-b02",
     "shape": "TextBox 4",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 6473952,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "CHHATTISGARH FORMAL SURVEY REPORT  •  08",
     "role": "footer"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08-b03",
     "shape": "TextBox 6",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Education: schools, colleges, technical institutes, universities, and skill-development centres operate across the state.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08-b04",
     "shape": "TextBox 8",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2194560,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Healthcare: government hospitals, community health centres, primary health centres, and frontline health workers provide services.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08-b05",
     "shape": "TextBox 10",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 3154680,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Transport and utilities: roads, railways, electricity, mobile networks, and water-supply systems support communities and industry.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08-b06",
     "shape": "TextBox 12",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 6446520,
     "text": "Urban services: major cities provide markets, public facilities, waste-management services, and selected digital and smart-city systems.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08-b07",
     "shape": "TextBox 14",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2194560,
     "left": 6446520,
     "text": "Access and quality can vary by region, with specialist healthcare and utilities harder to reach in some remote areas.",
     "role": "item"
    }
   ],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "index": 9,
   "layout": "Blank",
   "shape_count": 14,
   "picture_shapes": 0,
   "has_notes": false,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "s09-b01",
     "shape": "TextBox 2",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 320040,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "CHALLENGES",
     "role": "title"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09-b02",
     "shape": "TextBox 4",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 6473952,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "CHHATTISGARH FORMAL SURVEY REPORT  •  09",
     "role": "footer"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09-b03",
     "shape": "TextBox 6",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Uneven access to healthcare and education, rural connectivity gaps, post-harvest losses, and limited cold-chain storage.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09-b04",
     "shape": "TextBox 8",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2194560,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Market-access barriers for local producers and artisans.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09-b05",
     "shape": "TextBox 10",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 3154680,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Mining and industrial activity can cause air and water pollution, land disturbance, and worker-safety risks.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09-b06",
     "shape": "TextBox 12",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 6446520,
     "text": "Infrastructure projects must consider forests, wildlife, and local communities.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s09-b07",
     "shape": "TextBox 14",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2194560,
     "left": 6446520,
     "text": "Ensure investment, technology, and skill-development benefits reach small businesses, rural residents, and tribal communities fairly.",
     "role": "item"
    }
   ],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "layout": "Blank",
   "shape_count": 18,
   "picture_shapes": 0,
   "has_notes": false,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "s10-b01",
     "shape": "TextBox 2",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 320040,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "SUGGESTIONS / MODIFICATIONS",
     "role": "title"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10-b02",
     "shape": "TextBox 4",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 6473952,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "CHHATTISGARH FORMAL SURVEY REPORT  •  10",
     "role": "footer"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10-b03",
     "shape": "TextBox 6",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Set up affordable solar-powered cold rooms and shared processing units near farming and forest-produce clusters.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10-b04",
     "shape": "TextBox 8",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2194560,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Improve mine and factory safety with sensors, worker alerts, preventive maintenance, and regular training.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10-b05",
     "shape": "TextBox 10",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 3154680,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Expand telemedicine, offline-capable health tools, and reliable emergency transport for remote settlements.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10-b06",
     "shape": "TextBox 12",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 4114800,
     "left": 914400,
     "text": "Support tribal artisans through fair-price digital marketplaces, product photography, packaging, and direct buyer links.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10-b07",
     "shape": "TextBox 14",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 1234440,
     "left": 6446520,
     "text": "Provide portable science kits, maker spaces, regional-language learning resources, and industry mentorship.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10-b08",
     "shape": "TextBox 16",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 2194560,
     "left": 6446520,
     "text": "Encourage cleaner production, wastewater treatment, recycling, renewable energy, and restoration of mined land.",
     "role": "item"
    },
    {
     "id": "s10-b09",
     "shape": "TextBox 18",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 3154680,
     "left": 6446520,
     "text": "Consult local residents and monitor accessibility, environmental effects, and fair distribution of benefits.",
     "role": "item"
    }
   ],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "index": 11,
   "layout": "Blank",
   "shape_count": 12,
   "picture_shapes": 0,
   "has_notes": false,
   "blocks": [
    {
     "id": "s11-b01",
     "shape": "TextBox 2",
     "para": 0,
     "top": 320040,
     "left": 594360,
     "text": "GOVERNMENT FACILITIES AND SCHEMES",
     "role": "title"
